/// Recognizes when the user has pressed down at the same location for a long
/// period of time.
/// The gesture must not deviate in position from its touch down point for 500ms
/// until it’s recognized. Once the gesture is accepted, the finger can be
/// moved, triggering <code>onLongPressMoveUpdate</code> callbacks, unless the
/// <code>postAcceptSlopTolerance</code> constructor argument is specified.
/// <code>LongPressGestureRecognizer</code> may compete on pointer events of
/// <code>kPrimaryButton</code>, <code>kSecondaryButton</code>, and/or <code>kTertiaryButton</code> if at least
