/// Tracks the relationship between mouse devices and annotations, and
/// triggers mouse-related callbacks and cursor changes.
/// The <code>MouseTracker</code> tracks the state of connected mouse devices and the
/// <code>MouseTrackerAnnotation</code>s that each device is hovering over. It dispatches
/// <code>PointerEnterEvent</code> and <code>PointerExitEvent</code> as annotations are entered and
