/// Displays its children in a one-dimensional array.
/// A <code>RenderFlex</code> lays out each child and attempts to place the child adjacent
/// to the previous child in the main axis, given by <code>direction</code>, leaving
/// <code>spacing</code> logical pixels between each child.
/// In Dart this class extends <code>RenderBox</code> and mixes in
/// <code>ContainerRenderObjectMixin<RenderBox, FlexParentData></code>,
/// <code>RenderBoxContainerDefaultsMixin<RenderBox, FlexParentData></code>, and
/// <code>DebugOverflowIndicatorMixin</code>.
/// Since Swift does not support generic mixins, the container management
